+### Transferring a user to another organization
+
+`POST /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}/transfer` moves a user (for example between
+group companies) to the organization `toOrgId`.
+
+- Only org admins of `{orgID}` may transfer its users (others → 403). A caller
+  outside `{orgID}` → 404, and so does a user who does not belong to `{orgID}`.
+- `toOrgId` must be an existing organization (one that some user or project
+  belongs to), and must differ from `{orgID}`; otherwise → 400.
+- The user loses every project membership (all of them are in the old
+  organization) and every task assigned to them is unassigned, so the model
+  rules keep holding. The user's org admin flag is cleared: it does not carry
+  over to the new organization.
+
